  'delivery_second_block_text' => '<div class="title-block__top"><span>2.</span> Payment</div><div class="text"> Any payment method can be selected during checkout.</div>',
  'delivery_second_block_text2' => '<div class="title">Weekend</div><p> You can place orders and pay for them on weekends and holidays. Production of paid orders will begin on the next business day.</p>',
  'delivery_second_block_box1' => '<p>Bank transfer to account</p>',
  'delivery_second_block_box2' => '<p>Payment upon receipt in our workshop</p>',
  'delivery_second_block_box3' => '<p>Payment at time of delivery<br> <span class="orange">*only Latvia, Lithuania, Estonia</span></p>',
  'delivery_third_block_text_top' => 'We guarantee the quality of canvas prints, portraits and caricatures.
If the result does not match the approved design or the product is damaged during delivery — <span>we will remake your order for free or issue a refund.</span>',
  'delivery_third_block_box1' => '<p>The final canvas image differs from the design approved before printing.</p>',
  'delivery_third_block_box2' => '<p>Mechanical damage to the canvas, frame or packaging is found upon delivery.</p>',
  'delivery_third_block_box3' => '<p>There are visible defects in printing or assembly not caused by the customer.</p>',
  'delivery_third_block_text' => 'Quality guarantee and returns for canvas prints, portraits and caricatures',
