  'delivery_del_block_title' => '<div class="title-block__top"><span>3.</span> Delivery</div><div class="text"> “It&#39;s convenient, fast and inexpensive”</div>',
  'delivery_del_block_curier' => 'Delivery of canvas prints, caricatures, and portraits is carried out by trusted courier services: Venipak, Omniva, DPD.
All orders are carefully packaged to ensure your artwork arrives safely without damage.',
  'delivery_del_block_info' => 'Have questions about delivery of canvas prints, portraits, or caricatures?<br>
Contact us at <a href="mailto:orders@viarcanvas.com">orders@viarcanvas.com</a><br>
or call <br> <a href="tel:+37127044470">+371 27044470</a> — we’ll help you choose the best delivery option for your city.',
  'delivery_del_block_contact' => 'Message us on WhatsApp — reply in 5–10 minutes',
  'delivery_third_title' => 'Delivery (canvas prints, portraits, caricatures)',
  'delivery_second_title' => 'Payment methods <br> It’s safe',
  'delivery_services_title' => 'Our services',
  'delivery_second_text' => 'Choose a convenient payment method during checkout.

Secure payment options are available: online banking, card (Visa/Mastercard), Apple Pay, Google Pay, PayPal, bank transfer, or partial prepayment.

To start your order faster, we recommend paying immediately. If needed, you can request a preview approval before payment — simply indicate this during checkout.',
  'delivery_first_title' => 'Production time <br> for canvas prints and portraits',
  'delivery_first_text' => 'Production of canvas prints, photo portraits, and caricatures begins immediately after order confirmation and receipt of payment or deposit. All stages — from image quality check to canvas printing and stretching on a wooden frame — are carried out in our studio with full quality control.

Production time depends on the product type and the complexity of processing:',
  'delivery_third_text' => 'We deliver canvas prints, portraits, and caricatures to Latvia, Lithuania, Estonia,Finland, Poland, and Germany — quickly, safely, and with guaranteed protection. Choose the most convenient delivery option: courier, pickup point, or local collection.',
  'reproduction_gallery_title' => 'Reproduction paintings: ViarCanvas gallery',
  'reproduction_our_bestsellers' => 'Custom painting reproductions: our bestsellers',
  'reproduction_viarcanvas_is' => 'Why is it worth buying reproductions of paintings from us?',
