    'tab_portrait_oil_tab' => 
    array (
      'about__block_t11' => 'Photo of the future portrait',
      'about__block_t12' => '<span class="orange">The first and most important step</span> is to choose good photos for the future portrait and define the general idea. If you already have a good photo that you want the artist to repaint, this is the easiest option. The artist will immediately start working on the masterpiece.',
      'about__block_t13' => 'If you only have a photo of a face and want to change the background and surroundings, you will need <span class="orange">to discuss the details and options with the artist.</span> He will make some composition proposals on the computer, which you can see and approve.',
      'about__block_t14' => '<span class="orange">Quality<br> photo</span><br> for the best result',
      'about__block_t21' => 'An artist draws a sketch',
      'about__block_t22' => '<span class="orange">The second step</span> - when the image is agreed upon, the artist starts working. The artist, according to your wishes, makes a pencil sketch on canvas!',
      'about__block_t23' => 'In our workshop ViarCanvas we use only high-quality <span class="orange">natural canvas</span> !',
      'about__block_t24' => 'Brightness and durability of materials for over <span class="orange">100 years!</span> The canvas will retain its tension and will not sag!',
      'about__block_t25' => 'We take photos of <span class="orange">all stages</span> and send them to you by email.',
      'about__block_t31' => 'Underpainting',
      'about__block_t32' => '<span class="orange">The third step</span> is underpainting, in which the artist applies a thin layer of paint to the canvas to give it initial shape and volume.<br><br> It also highlights the darker and lighter areas. Once the first layer of paint has dried, the detailed work begins in several subsequent stages.',
      'about__block_t33' => 'The technique allows you to make the drawing more voluminous, lively and picturesque, giving it more depth and realism.',
      'about__block_t34' => 'Paints <span class="orange">on<br> 100% safe and environmentally friendly!</span>',
      'about__block_t41' => 'The final stage<br> + Portrait protection',
      'about__block_t42' => '<span class="orange">Step four</span> : our artist will draw all the details of the portrait.<br> Once the portrait is completely finished, we photograph it and send you high quality images for final approval.',
      'about__block_t43' => '<span class="orange">Be sure to cover the painting with varnish</span> to protect it from mechanical impact.',
      'about__block_t44' => '<span class="orange">Coating the painting with protective</span> acrylic varnish',
      'about__block_t51' => 'Design in a baguette frame',
      'about__block_t52' => '<span class="orange">The fifth step</span> - when the painting is stretched on a frame, it already becomes a ready and valuable gift.<br> However, to make the portrait look complete, we recommend framing it.',
      'about__block_t53' => '<span class="orange">We will provide you with several suitable options for baguette frames</span> - different types and price categories, from which you can choose the most suitable one.<br> This way, your portrait will acquire a finished and elegant look, and will become an even more attractive and stylish gift.',
      'about__block_t54' => '<span class="orange">Big<br> choice</span><br> baguette frames',
      'about__block_t61' => 'Packaging and Delivery',
      'about__block_t62' => '<span class="orange">Step six</span> - We take special care to ensure that the work remains in perfect condition during transportation.<br><br> We make significant efforts to ensure reliable protection of the work during transportation.<br><br> Our goal is to ensure that your piece of art will bring you only positive emotions, despite any movement and delivery.',
      'about__block_t63' => 'Delivery to any <span class="orange">countries and cities in Europe</span>',
    ),
    'tab_portrait_oil_tab_text' => 'Oil portrait',
    'tab_two_pictures_tab' => 
    array (
      't11' => 'We offer <span class="orange">2 types of design</span>',
      't12' => 'You can choose the type of portrait in the order form!',
      't13' => 'Oil portrait<br> <span class="orange">On canvas</span>',
      't14' => 'Our studio uses only 100% quality materials.<br> We purchase all materials in rolls, cut them to the required dimensions, and also make stretchers ourselves and stretch the canvases onto them.',
      't15' => '<span class="orange">Gallery stretch canvas</span><br> on a wooden stretcher!',
      't16' => '<span class="orange">100%</span> natural canvas!',
      't17' => 'Coating <span class="orange">with acrylic varnish or textured gel.</span>',
      't21' => 'Portrait in oil on canvas<br> <span class="orange">in a baguette frame</span>',
      't22' => 'ViarCanvas Studio offers a wide range of baguette frames that will highlight the beauty and uniqueness of your painting, giving it a complete and elegant look.',
      't23' => '<span class="orange">Selection according to taste</span>',
      't24' => 'The range of frame types and styles allows you to choose the perfect frame that suits your preferences and complements the character and mood of the painting.',
      't25' => '<span class="orange">Protection and durability</span>',
      't26' => 'The baguette frame not only aesthetically improves the overall appearance of the painting, but also serves as its protection from possible damage, ensuring its durability and safety over time.',
      't27' => '<span class="orange">Professional design</span>',
      't28' => 'ViarCanvas Studio offers experience and professionalism in framing paintings, guaranteeing high quality work and attention to every detail.',
